{"id":"630186","name":"煎蛋什香菜汤米粉","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630186/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"柴鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"什香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鲜米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香辣红油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"早市上买的鲜米粉。","img":"images/630186/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡发的木耳适量。","img":"images/630186/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"什香菜洗净。","img":"images/630186/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里适量油烧热，打入一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/630186/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"两面煎微微焦黄但还是溏心状态。","img":"images/630186/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切成大块。","img":"images/630186/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅留底油，姜蒜炒香。","img":"images/630186/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入适量开水。","img":"images/630186/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入木耳煮开。","img":"images/630186/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，味精调一下味儿。","img":"images/630186/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下入米粉。","img":"images/630186/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入一勺儿自己做的香辣红油。","img":"images/630186/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"鲜米粉不用多煮，煮一滚儿即可。","img":"images/630186/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入煎蛋和什香菜。","img":"images/630186/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"搅匀关火。","img":"images/630186/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/630186/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/630186/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}